<title>USA: Mansur Industries Inc Q4 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Mansur Industries Inc Q4 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	$ 0.17     loss	 $0.22</p>
<p> Net	   loss	   770     loss	   592</p>
<p> Revs			   540			nil</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,553		    2,663</p>
<p>		 year</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.78     loss	 $0.66</p>
<p> Net	   loss	 2,646     loss	 1,541</p>
<p> Revs			   736			nil</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,378		    2,335</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company completed its intitial public offering of 1,100,000 common shares in 1996.</p>
<p>Net income for the fourth quarter of 1995 was calculated after the payment of $73,000 in dividends to preferred shareholders.</p>
<p>Net income for fiscal 1995 and 1996 were calculated after the payment of $147,000 and $222,000 respectively in dividends to preferred shareholders.</p>
<p>A company statement said: &quot;As the company commenced its principal operations in July 1996, it had no revenues in prior periods.&quot;</p>
